source gates, the ordinary build, production reproduction/readiness and twelve before/after source-identity checks passed. The gated snapshot workflow independently repeated qualification before freezing this exact source.\n\nThe attached `source-qualification.json` and `source-qualification-evidence.zip` retain the original workflow snapshots, raw logs, test partitions and source identities. Local browser smoke covered Solo, Versus, Team and actual fullscreen; an ordinary packaged build completed core offline preparation, offline reload and First Signal through normal controls.\n\nPublic play/offline acceptance is recorded separately after deployment; this source qualification does not claim it. Physical-device qualification remains separate from browser/model checks. P00 remains open until its public acceptance is recorded.\n"}